WEBVTT

00:01:56.516 --> 00:02:00.276
not sure if their colors match right

00:02:00.996 --> 00:02:04.316
I wonder if lightning needs an alarm clock

00:02:04.316 --> 00:02:05.876
to know when to crack

00:02:05.876 --> 00:02:08.116
if rivers ever stop

00:02:08.116 --> 00:02:10.076
and think of turning back

00:02:10.356 --> 00:02:12.916
if streams meet the wrong sea

00:02:12.916 --> 00:02:15.356
and their whole lives run off-track

00:02:15.956 --> 00:02:18.996
I wonder if the snow

00:02:18.996 --> 00:02:20.756
wants to be black

00:02:21.196 --> 00:02:23.876
if the soil thinks she’s too dark

00:02:23.956 --> 00:02:27.436
if butterflies want
to cover up their marks

00:02:27.436 --> 00:02:30.676
if rocks are self-conscious
of their weight